flowchart LR
    U[学生] --> UI[悬浮球与 Bottom Sheet]
    UI -->|JWT + SSE| H[AI Handler]
    H --> S[AI Service]
    S --> C[上下文组装器]
    C --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
    C --> R[(Redis 缓存)]
    S --> O[OpenAI 兼容服务]
    O -->|短文本或工具调用| S
    S -->|校验推荐| PG
    S -->|delta / card| UI
    UI -->|用户确认| B[预约服务]
    B --> PG
